    "## Final Project Personal Notebook\n",
    "**Dataset**: Pittsburgh Police Arrest Data \\\n",
    "**Metric**: Which neighborhood in Pittsburgh is the safest?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Connection to Data**: To determine which Pittsburgh is the safeSt, using the dataset, I evaluated the number of arrests in each neighborhood. Then, of the neighborhoods with the lowest number of arrests, I identified which percent of the arrests were property crimes compared to other types of crimes. \\\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations**: I acknowledge that arrest data does not directly reflect the crime rate of a city, but rather the police activity and cities with larger populations are likely to experience more arrests.
   ]
  },
